ments": 163}, {"date": "2026-09-13", "plays": 454388, "likes": 14779, "comments": 188}, {"date": "2026-09-20", "plays": 581552, "likes": 17557, "comments": 206}], "still_climbing": false, "transcript": "Okay, I think this might be one of my favorite ways to wake up lately. I put the MediCube PDRN gel mask on as the last step of my night routine and sleep in it overnight. By morning it turns completely transparent and peeling it off is so satisfying. My skin always looks so hydrated. Next is the PDRN Collagen Neck Gua Sha Cream. I've been dipping it in ice water first, which feels amazing. The gua sha is built right into the applicator, so I use it along my jawline and neck to massage everything in. And I don't stop at my face. I bring it down across my neck, decolletage, collarbones, and even my underarms. This has PDRN, collagen, and 5% volume fullene to help plump and firm the skin and smooth the look of fine lines. Plus, the built-in gua sha gives you a gentle massage and helps with puffiness. Then I swipe on the PDRN Multi Balm. It's one of my favorite firming sticks. After just a week, my skin looked noticeably more plump and firm. I use it every day for that plumper look without the painful, expensive fillers. And this is the finished result. Hydrated, de-puffed, glassy looking skin, and honestly, such a relaxing way to start my morning. I linked all three MediCube products on my Amazon storefront if you want to try them yourself.", "is_relevant": false}, {"shortCode": "DcmrDdrMlAY", "url": "https://www.instagram.com/p/DcmrDdrMlAY/", "caption": "Friendly reminder not to neglect that laundry room! \ud83e\uddfd\ud83e\udee7\u2728 Let\u2019s clean, reset & restock one of my fave rooms in the house! \n\n#deepclean #blackmomsofinstagram #cleanhome #organizedhome #asmr", "timestamp": "2026-08-29T00:42:42.000Z", "videoDuration": 156.666672, "videoPlayCount": 2635354, "videoViewCount": null, "likesCount": 131580, "commentsCount": 1435, "displayUrl": "https://instagram.